WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[Record] User records vocals via MediaRecorder API

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Gemini Vocal Analyst processes tone, pitch, energy & genre

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
[Generate] Lyric Writer + Beat Producer + Mix Engineer run in parallel

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
[Mix] Lyria Pro generates an 8-bar beat loop at detected BPM

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Mix Engineer plans EQ, compression & reverb settings

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
[Master] FFmpeg mastering chain: parametric EQ → multi-band compression → limiting

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.500
Track reaches -14 LUFS / -1.0 dBTP true peak — streaming ready
